# Relative Timelock Script (P2SH Redeem Script)
# This script locks funds for a relative time period (e.g., 144 blocks = ~1 day)
# Uses OP_CHECKSEQUENCEVERIFY instead of OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY

# Redeem Script:
<sequence> OP_CHECKSEQUENCEVERIFY OP_DROP <pubkey> OP_CHECKSIG

# To spend, scriptSig must be:
# <signature> <redeem_script>

# Example with 144 blocks relative locktime (approximately 1 day)
# PubKey: 0279be667ef9dcbbac55a06295ce870b07029bfcdb2dce28d959f2815b16f81798
144 OP_CHECKSEQUENCEVERIFY OP_DROP 0279be667ef9dcbbac55a06295ce870b07029bfcdb2dce28d959f2815b16f81798 OP_CHECKSIG